status GREEN on this lap's own work -- reds_ledger_monotone GREEN with all eleven new legs, the discrimination proven load-bearing on metal, four touched pages A+ at meter, both pins under bound with 125 bytes on the card and 3,354 on the ledger. reds_spine_derive stands RED on the same %530 double-binding it stood red on before this lap; that is the half awaiting a word, and the two guards now agree about it.

recommend check-in (Keaton) -- two want your word. %530: which of the two rows moves, unchanged from last lap and now visible from inside the tree as well as against the remote, so the two guards agree about it. THE ADOPTION: 151 controls have not imported the plant law; each falls on touch, and whether a sweep takes them in one pass is a call about six ships' rooms. Meanwhile the midnight red stands -- rota_declared refuses the cold open on any tree that opens before the day's first log lands, twice measured, one line in a peer's guard.
